# Deploy only with permission

Do not upload this project to the server unless the user explicitly asks to deploy or upload in the current message.

That includes `npm run deploy`, `scripts/deploy-hostinger.sh`, rsync, scp, SSH copies into the hosting account, and publishing a zip to pranavps.com.

A local build, a local zip, or an edit to the site is not permission to deploy. Words like "fix this", "add this", or "is there anything we have to do" are not permission either.

If the live site needs the change and the user has not asked to deploy, say so and wait.

```text
User: add the tag to the head
Do: edit the file. Stop. Do not run npm run deploy.

User: deploy this
Do: run npm run deploy.
```
